OL,3,GNEWSAMacbeth to be performed in town's
OL,4,Alast nightclub
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the Oldham Coliseum Theatre's
OL,7,Fdoors remain closed during its major
OL,8,Frevamp, the creative team has needed to
OL,9,Fthink outside the box when deciding
OL,10,Fwhere to temporarily decamp.
OL,12,FThey have chosen the last remaining
OL,13,Fnightclub in the Greater Manchester
OL,14,Ftown to stage William Shakespeare's
OL,15,FMacbeth.
OL,17,F"I want to blow the dust off
OL,18,FShakespeare," said the Coliseum's new
OL,19,Fcreative director Nick Bagnall.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
