OL,5,
OL,6,F"This isn't about putting the play on a
OL,7,Fpedestal, it's about creating an
OL,8,Fexperience that grabs people by the
OL,9,Fthroat, whether they have seen
OL,10,FMacbethb@/10 times or never encountered
OL,11,Fit before.
